Versions marked by an asterisk * were ShareWare release versions.
Versions marked by a pound sign # were Beta-Tested versions only.

Version/Major Revision/Minor Revision/Patch History
===================================================

#Patch .9e1
-----------

        Compiled: 3/10/94

    -o Challenging players no more than 4 levels beneath you, working
       properly.
    -o Player Name for new users now recorded properly. (This caused a
       number of errors)
    -o Challenged player no longer 'freezes' when touching a wall.
    -o Challenged player no longer 'walks all over you'.
    -o key file debug code removed.
    -o The game no longer tries to save a 'missing' user file when
       aborting from the 'ANSI/Numlock/IBM.font' opening screen.

#Minor Revision .9e
-------------------

        Compiled: 2/22/94

    -o Key file support for registered versions.
    -o Multiple attacks above level 4 working properly now.
    -o BattleG: assignment removed.  Now uses BattleG.config in S: for
       paths.
    -o Documentation files are now in AmigaGuide format.
    -o Archive is sent to beta-testers as 'ready for release', pending
       'no bugs' go ahead...

#Minor Revision .9d
-------------------

        Compiled: 2/14/94

    -o Optimized the character information display.
    -o Wining character now receives all of the losing characters gold.
    -o Added time keeping for better sysop control of the game.  Can now
       configure the time allowed in the door.
    -o Characters can now only fight other users no more than four levels
       beneath them.
    -o The player's hit points are now reset when they log back in.

#Minor Revision .9c
-------------------

    -o Changed Screen clears to speed them up.
    -o Took out the 23-24 line terminal stuff.  Now it is
       strictly a 23 line game.

#Minor Revision .9b
-------------------

    -o Paging bug fixed.  Now User vs. User combat works properly.
    -o Fixed blue screen clear after reaching level 19.

*Patch .9a2
-----------

    -o First Shareware release!!!
    -o Game now checks for Upper and lower case letters in your player name.

#Patch .9a1
-----------

    -o fixed character creation sequence bug.

#Major Revision .9a
-------------------

    -o User against user combat added.
    -o Race/Class selection removed.
    -o More monsters added.
    -o Fixed RollDie() bug.  Now generates random numbers.
    -o Maximum level is 20 instead of 8.
    -o High score table added.
    -o Player data file added for user-user and eventually multi-node
       combat.

#Patch .8b1
-----------

    -o Assign of BATTLEG: made.
    -o Screen shortened to 24 lines.
    -o Program now displays version number and creation date.

#Version .8b
------------

    -o User documentation added.
    -o ReDraw() function added in main menu.
    -o Added ANSI/IBM usage screen.